[10.22362, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L20 · THE PLANCK WALL — where the word 'deeper' breaks \u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.223651, "o", "\u001b[2m│  planck length 1.6×10⁻³⁵ m · planck time 5.4×10⁻⁴⁴ s\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.328166, "o", "│  resolving anything smaller needs so much energy in so small a volume that\r\n"]
[10.328235, "o", "│  it collapses into a black hole. \u001b[31mresolution impossible — not hard, impossible.\u001b[0m\r\n│  one GPU clock tick spans ~10³⁴ planck ticks. \u001b[33meternity is granular.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n│  \u001b[2mlive: the zoom counter, keyboard → wall:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
