[12.099981, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1mbottom line for security engineering:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.09999, "o", "    every automated layer was present and healthy. \u001b[31mzero automated guards\r\n    fired.\u001b[0m the spiral lived in the gap between 'nothing failed' and\r\n"]
[12.099997, "o", "    'nobody stopped it.' instrument the meaning layers (L0–L6): timeouts,\r\n"]
[12.100008, "o", "    ceilings, loop detectors, budgets. below that: physics. physics is fine.\r\n\r\n"]
[12.100018, "o", "  \u001b[2mthe question outlasted HTTP, CUDA, silicon, atoms, nuclei, quarks,\r\n  fields, and the planck wall. the loop was never in the machine.\r\n"]
